# masked.scn: a masked line, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Ticks latch their line while it is disabled and no handler runs; the stale tick is delivered at the next RTC
# edge once enabled. A tick acknowledged while disabled is gone when the line is enabled again.
tick 1
idle 2
tick 0
enable 0x0100
idle 1
disable 0x0100
tick 1
idle 1
ack 0x0100
tick 0
enable 0x0100
idle 2
